(7522874, 1202257, 163081, '<td valign="top">If you cropped out the bottom half of the picture, you could TT easily. That subtle red car is very clever. A 5 from me.  A 7 or 8 if you kept the top half of this picture</td>', 'If you cropped out the bottom half of the picture, you could TT easily. That subtle red car is very clever. A 5 from me.  A 7 or 8 if you kept the top half of this picture', '2017-07-11 14:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522886, 1202122, 30861, '<td valign="top">THAT is red-full-of-fun! I rather wish the walking figure top left of center wasn''t there, but we can''t have everything :-) Great answer to the challenge! 8</td>', 'THAT is red-full-of-fun! I rather wish the walking figure top left of center wasn''t there, but we can''t have everything :-) Great answer to the challenge! 8', '2017-07-11 17:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522888, 1201649, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s RED :-) It''s skillfully done, technically. It doesn''t in any way touch me emotionally. Also I''m bothered by how the second-from-right vase touches its neighbor, I so want to see a clean gap there. A 6 from me.</td>', 'Well, it''s RED :-) It''s skillfully done, technically. It doesn''t in any way touch me emotionally. Also I''m bothered by how the second-from-right vase touches its neighbor, I so want to see a clean gap there. A 6 from me.', '2017-07-11 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522889, 1202267, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s an image of a feather. It''s red. That''s as far as it goes for me. Attention has been paid to shallow DOF, but other than that it''s just kind of *there*, and it doesn''t engage me at all. For this reason, I give it a 4.</td>', 'It''s an image of a feather. It''s red. That''s as far as it goes for me. Attention has been paid to shallow DOF, but other than that it''s just kind of *there*, and it doesn''t engage me at all. For this reason, I give it a 4.', '2017-07-11 17:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522890, 1202260, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very soothing, very pleasing, nice use of DOF, nice detail with the droplets, luminous colors; all these are plusses for me. On the other hand, the image doesn''t really engage me, and more and more that''s what I''m looking for. Still, it''s a lovely, luminous image and I give you a 7.</td>', 'Very soothing, very pleasing, nice use of DOF, nice detail with the droplets, luminous colors; all these are plusses for me. On the other hand, the image doesn''t really engage me, and more and more that''s what I''m looking for. Still, it''s a lovely, luminous image and I give you a 7.', '2017-07-11 17:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522891, 1202288, 30861, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot to like in this image, especially conceptually, but in the end it''s not really working to its (imagined) potential; I want more from it. This feels like a hurried bit of work in a situation where a little more attention to the compositional equations would have paid huge dividends. It certainly answers the "red" theme, though :-) 6 from me.</td>', 'There''s a lot to like in this image, especially conceptually, but in the end it''s not really working to its (imagined) potential; I want more from it. This feels like a hurried bit of work in a situation where a little more attention to the compositional equations would have paid huge dividends. It certainly answers the "red" theme, though :-) 6 from me.', '2017-07-11 17:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522892, 1202257, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure I smell Jeb or Vivi on this one, considering the MGB in the background. I really WANT to like this image, but the minimal editing has tripped it up. The whole thing feels washed-out and a little clumsy :-( Reds are especially hard to render in JPG, so that''s part of the problem. I gave this a 4.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure I smell Jeb or Vivi on this one, considering the MGB in the background. I really WANT to like this image, but the minimal editing has tripped it up. The whole thing feels washed-out and a little clumsy :-( Reds are especially hard to render in JPG, so that''s part of the problem. I gave this a 4.', '2017-07-11 17:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522893, 1202263, 30861, '<td valign="top">Conceptually this image was a good idea, but from my POV circumstances let you down; the light itself is so diffused and watery that the image lacks oomph in my eyes. I do love a shingled beach, though :-) I give this a 5</td>', 'Conceptually this image was a good idea, but from my POV circumstances let you down; the light itself is so diffused and watery that the image lacks oomph in my eyes. I do love a shingled beach, though :-) I give this a 5', '2017-07-11 17:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522894, 1201829, 30861, '<td valign="top">You''ve got the red part nailed here, that''s for sure. But I find it uncomfortable that the bokeh BG is demanding all my attention and the blossoms feel like an afterthought. The image isn''t giving me much reason to stop and savor it, so I find myself anxious to move on. I gave it a 5.</td>', 'You''ve got the red part nailed here, that''s for sure. But I find it uncomfortable that the bokeh BG is demanding all my attention and the blossoms feel like an afterthought. The image isn''t giving me much reason to stop and savor it, so I find myself anxious to move on. I gave it a 5.', '2017-07-11 17:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522895, 1202290, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s a hell of a Mantis photo. It doesn''t *really* push my red button, if I''m honest, but still. Eerie, otherworldly, visually articulate, and worth a 7 to me. It might end up bumped to 8 when I am adjusting, even :-)</td>', 'That''s a hell of a Mantis photo. It doesn''t *really* push my red button, if I''m honest, but still. Eerie, otherworldly, visually articulate, and worth a 7 to me. It might end up bumped to 8 when I am adjusting, even :-)', '2017-07-11 17:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522896, 1201764, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m a real sucker for ordinary or banal objects elevated by light, color, and the photographer''s attention. A felicitous study of color and form that soothes and intrigues me at the same time. A 7 from me.</td>', 'I''m a real sucker for ordinary or banal objects elevated by light, color, and the photographer''s attention. A felicitous study of color and form that soothes and intrigues me at the same time. A 7 from me.', '2017-07-11 17:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7522992, 1202290, 28742, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick, but I suspect it''ll end up around 10th place. Hoping it ribbons, though - even if the <i>subject</i> is not red. :)</td>', 'This is my top pick, but I suspect it''ll end up around 10th place. Hoping it ribbons, though - even if the subject is not red. :)', '2017-07-12 07:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
