(7523246, 1202037, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s a red building, no getting around that :-) If I''m not mistaken, it''s in Singapore? Didn''t I hear they were gonna restore it to its original colors? Anyway, that''s neither here nor there. I can''t say the image really works for me. The lighting is blah, the blue pedestrian is a real eye-trap, and overall the cropping/framing of the image seems way too dense to me. It meets the challenge head-on, no holds barred, so for that you get a 6 from me.</td>', 'That''s a red building, no getting around that :-) If I''m not mistaken, it''s in Singapore? Didn''t I hear they were gonna restore it to its original colors? Anyway, that''s neither here nor there. I can''t say the image really works for me. The lighting is blah, the blue pedestrian is a real eye-trap, and overall the cropping/framing of the image seems way too dense to me. It meets the challenge head-on, no holds barred, so for that you get a 6 from me.', '2017-07-13 19:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523247, 1201811, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well, it ISred, I''ll give you that. Otherwise a thoroughly ordinary image to my eyes at least, and seriously marred by the glare in the upper right. I can see where the whole image could have been framed differently, from closer in probably, and it might have worked better. I give it a 5.</td>', 'Well, it ISred, I''ll give you that. Otherwise a thoroughly ordinary image to my eyes at least, and seriously marred by the glare in the upper right. I can see where the whole image could have been framed differently, from closer in probably, and it might have worked better. I give it a 5.', '2017-07-13 19:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523248, 1202127, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lotta red, lotta excitement, but in the end the image isn''t reaching me at any other level. I''ll give it a 6 for <i>Joie de vive</i>.</td>', 'Lotta red, lotta excitement, but in the end the image isn''t reaching me at any other level. I''ll give it a 6 for Joie de vive.', '2017-07-13 19:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523249, 1202055, 30861, '<td valign="top">Whoa! Here I am scrolling along voting bright, bright, BRIGHT red pictures, then WHOMP! It''s the Cave where Red was born! In a lot of ways I like this a lot, but for me it''s not as well-realized as it could have been. A little careful work in post in the darkest part of the peppers to bring them up half a zone or so would have provided a boost to the 3-dimensionality of the image. The empty space to the right isn''t helping you at all, all the more so because the pepper/BG division is so danged vertical. It''s such and abrupt stoppage. I''d love to see one more pepper low and in the back on the right, fading into the cave :-) Also it would be great if you could change the WB on the bottom-most reflection so it was a lot less blue... A 7 from me.</td>', 'Whoa! Here I am scrolling along voting bright, bright, BRIGHT red pictures, then WHOMP! It''s the Cave where Red was born! In a lot of ways I like this a lot, but for me it''s not as well-realized as it could have been. A little careful work in post in the darkest part of the peppers to bring them up half a zone or so would have provided a boost to the 3-dimensionality of the image. The empty space to the right isn''t helping you at all, all the more so because the pepper/BG division is so danged vertical. It''s such and abrupt stoppage. I''d love to see one more pepper low and in the back on the right, fading into the cave :-) Also it would be great if you could change the WB on the bottom-most reflection so it was a lot less blue... A 7 from me.', '2017-07-13 19:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523250, 1202253, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautiful red, reasonably dynamic composition, nice dewdrops on the rose. The upper areas aren''t performing real well for you; you could imagine a more positive leaf-and-light experience up there. A 6 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful red, reasonably dynamic composition, nice dewdrops on the rose. The upper areas aren''t performing real well for you; you could imagine a more positive leaf-and-light experience up there. A 6 from me.', '2017-07-13 19:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523251, 1202275, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s red! There''s even a sort of homely, gritty integrity to the image, But in the end it feels haphazard to me, not thought-out at all. The focus is strangely placed, the noise is disturbing, the lighting is flat, and I just can''t really get behind the image :-( It''s a 4 from me.</td>', 'It''s red! There''s even a sort of homely, gritty integrity to the image, But in the end it feels haphazard to me, not thought-out at all. The focus is strangely placed, the noise is disturbing, the lighting is flat, and I just can''t really get behind the image :-( It''s a 4 from me.', '2017-07-13 19:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523252, 1202243, 30861, '<td valign="top">That''s EXUBERANT! It''s RED! It sings to me well beyond any questions of its technical or photographic "merit". I love the adult in the chair foreground left. It''s altogether an image that tells a story and I''m glad you shared it with us. A 9 from me.</td>', 'That''s EXUBERANT! It''s RED! It sings to me well beyond any questions of its technical or photographic "merit". I love the adult in the chair foreground left. It''s altogether an image that tells a story and I''m glad you shared it with us. A 9 from me.', '2017-07-13 19:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523253, 1201865, 30861, '<td valign="top">I see a rectangle full of angular sections of a red hypercar. But it doesn''t work for me, and I''m a car nut. The composition, the DOF, the demanding presence of the black-on-black wheel and tire, they just don''t work in harmony. I give it a 5.</td>', 'I see a rectangle full of angular sections of a red hypercar. But it doesn''t work for me, and I''m a car nut. The composition, the DOF, the demanding presence of the black-on-black wheel and tire, they just don''t work in harmony. I give it a 5.', '2017-07-13 19:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
